# The PostHog CLI keys for your own builds: see apps/native/README.md. Copy to
# .env.dev.local, which is gitignored; they live on your Mac only, never in .env.dev.
# With both set, the build uploads the source map and the dSYMs. Leave unset to skip the upload.
#
# Needs the CLI: npm install -g @posthog/cli@0.19.0

# A personal key with error_tracking:write and organization:read only, for your
# own builds. Revoke it when you stop building locally.
# POSTHOG_CLI_API_KEY=
# POSTHOG_CLI_PROJECT_ID=
